{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_title", "source_sha256": "9133b2a9ffb76143ec900a5ae6b9bf10eac18075edb49009e5b013fdd7a328bc", "ja": "～溢れる気持ち～", "zh": "～满溢的心意～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_synopsis", "source_sha256": "93d3b184c50d03d3875eb51d9fbb3b58e92bdbbfe9ad24fff8f0b76b0123492c", "ja": "大きなステージを目の前に、思わず\nたそがれるのり子と、涙ぐむ可憐。\nそんなふたりを慰める律子と昴。\n泣くのは本番の後だと気持ちを切り替え、\nみんなは大勢の観客の前に立った。", "zh": "面对巨大的舞台，法子不由得\n陷入了沉思，可怜也泛起了泪光。\n律子和昴则在安慰着这样的两人。\n大家转换好心情，想着要哭也等正式演出结束之后再哭，\n随后便站到了大批观众的面前。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1000_009rit", "source_sha256": "fe1f47d05ad9c9f0e74765625558802feba0b432cfe31e548b3b57acc27261eb", "ja": "そろそろステージも完成ね。あとはリハーサルで、\n本番に向けて最後の仕上げをするだけよ。", "zh": "舞台也差不多要完成了。接下来只要通过彩排，为正式演出做最后的准备就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "7caa1891c3d8e2e7881c86aa0273e16930e848b9f1f1e55ee7a895b6d8ce0430", "ja": "ああっ！　思いっきり振りかぶって、かっとばして\nいくぜ！　……あれ、のり子、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "啊！要使劲挥棒，把球狠狠打出去！……咦，诺莉子，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "07d0620e55a68e3cbb50937def57093a85c1d64bbdec666e760f3b53b2794574", "ja": "いや……。なんかさ、アタシ達、こんな所まで\n来れたんだなーって、ちょっとたそがれちゃって……。", "zh": "没有……就是觉得，我们居然都能走到这一步了啊——\n稍微有点感慨起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "3bd623e5f007dcdbc54357d75aa344e5d72e593b8cb795506c9a95ba8b31aa9f", "ja": "わ、わかります。た、大変なこともあったけど……\nい、一生懸命頑張って……こんなステージにまで……。", "zh": "我、我懂的。虽然也、也有过辛苦的事……\n但、拼命努力之后……竟然来到了这样的舞台上……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "a1ae76abead46789e1abc3e1ff51adff71d7ff26061a1fb6af192bf175b69cb5", "ja": "わあっ、可憐！？　な、泣かないでくれよ！\nなぁ、頼むから、落ち着いて……大丈夫だからな。", "zh": "哇啊，可怜！？别、别哭呀！\n我说，拜托了，冷静一下……没事的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "746160315c6b1e0f886a24bea582a43589009c5ccc602462f7cdd41836de1197", "ja": "うう、ごめんね昴ちゃん、心配かけて……ぐすっ。\nわ、私、私……。", "zh": "呜呜，对不起，昴，让你担心了……抽泣。\n我、我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "99e3b099804b01aedb8980e9d8b21b5fa54fecd1f3f9c34af5b01fbdf9b4963f", "ja": "いいのよ、可憐。大きなステージを前に\n気持ちが高まったら、私だって泣けてくるもの。", "zh": "没事的，可怜。在巨大的舞台面前，\n要是情绪涌上心头，连我都会想哭呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "2d63dd35d8155f46eaaaf26147428fba0ee019968c25f2ea25fd0a6a5032f74e", "ja": "律子さん……わかってくれますか。私、本番が来るのが\n怖くて、でも嬉しくて、楽しみで……ぐすっ、てへへ。", "zh": "律子小姐……能理解我吗。我啊，一想到正式演出要来了，\n就很害怕，但又好高兴，好期待……呜呜，嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "f367aa1dfc08d942eab172d45f4849885496439093bb59eeac08d1e3140f4d50", "ja": "アタシも……ぐすっ……で、でも、泣くのは一旦ヤメ！\n涙の続きは本番を乗り越えて、またそのあとにしよっ！", "zh": "我也是……呜……但、但是，先别哭了！\n等熬过正式演出，再接着哭吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "a2f8364fe70da2b3b5bdba6791bf7f50e88c40109d840df5fc888c55bafbdc68", "ja": "そうね。可憐、のり子、昴。最高の舞台にする\nために、気持ちを切り替えていきましょう！", "zh": "是啊。可怜、纪子、昴。为了打造最棒的舞台，\n让我们调整好心情继续吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "9bd0ed7b03d26bdc16fb4d664e92e08a824e6a25a49a6244038620c5139f398b", "ja": "み、みな、みなさん……その、本当に……ぐすっ。\nあ、ありがとうございますーっ！！", "zh": "大、大家，各位……那个，真的……呜。\n谢、谢谢大家——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "90221bb3b75fe1d1f06b4d4ab698d28f3253d804c9c642e2632cba799e04ed29", "ja": "このステージに立てたのは、応援してくれたみんなの\nおかげだよ！　最高の恩返しをするからねー！", "zh": "能站上这个舞台，都是多亏了一直为我加油的大家！我一定会用最棒的表现来报答你们——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "b8c5d3d64a54770276fda61a5c79cfab9e1d8c30fb632ded4d4f7bc07bff510a", "ja": "これがオレたちのステージだって、\n胸張れるように……気合い入れて行くぜーっ！！", "zh": "为了能自豪地说这是属于我们的舞台……拿出干劲上吧——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "ba801ccbd68fd50465eabf29df13e4b9e776cade551ef4701150ef5591d64fcf", "ja": "私達の本気が、皆さんの大切な思い出に\nなりますように……最後まで、見届けてくださいねー！", "zh": "希望我们的认真能成为大家珍贵的回忆……请陪我们看到最后哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_12_1014_audience", "source_sha256": "d4a24de7732f4fc96422562f5cbf6af59494bc5a2eff23580ef50ef09e85feb2", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアアアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
